CT,30,T
OL,0,          BTXT64  GMon 23.11.26 18:03:57
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FFeature overview         
OL,3,   EUltimateD]G                         
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5,CFeature overview                       
OL,6, -BAuto 60 second refreshG- always have 
OL,7,   the latest news on you screen. The   
OL,8,   refresh time can be adjusted to your 
OL,9,   preference.                          
OL,11, -BFastext supportGvia function keys -  
OL,12,   resembling the red, green, yellow and
OL,13,   cyan quick access keys from the      
OL,14,   TV-remote.                           
OL,16, - Two customBhand crafted 6x6 pixel    
OL,17,  Bcharacter setsG(thin & bold) - this  
OL,18,   leaves room for 1 pixel row of back- 
OL,19,   ground colour at the top and bottom  
OL,20,   of each character. This leads to a   
OL,21,   much better overall looking teletext 
OL,22,   screen imo.                          
OL,23,D]F303G<<                >>F305 B]D1/3  
OL,24,AMain page  BA-Z Index  CInstall  FAbout
FL,100,199,200,300,0,100
