OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FFeature overview         
OL,3,   EUltimateD]G                         
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5, -BSwitchGbetween the thin and bold     
OL,6,  Bfonts on the flyGwithin the program. 
OL,8, - If a requested page is not available 
OL,9,   online, it will show an older        
OL,10,   previous saved version of the page,  
OL,11,   if available. Handy for archival     
OL,12,   purposes.                            
OL,14, - Set yourBfavorite teletext station   
OL,15,   and start page with the config       
OL,16,   utility.                             
OL,18, -BDouble heightGtext,BblinkingGtext,   
OL,19,  Bhidden/concealedGtext that can be    
OL,20,   revealed.                            
OL,23,D]F303G<<                >>F305 B]D2/3  
