OL,0,          BTXT64  GMon 23.11.26 18:03:57
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FFeature overview         
OL,3,   EUltimateD]G                         
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5, -BAuto rotating subpagesGwith a        
OL,6,   configurable cycle time.             
OL,8, -BMouse supportG- Click page numbers.  
OL,9,   Right click takes you back to the    
OL,10,   page where you came from. And there  
OL,11,   is a little mouse menu for navigating
OL,12,   pages and bringing up the station    
OL,13,   select menu, which also is mouse     
OL,14,   operated.                            
OL,16, -BQuick navigationG- an easy way to    
OL,17,   pick a page number and go back to    
OL,18,   where you came from.                 
